<title>USA: Micro Linear sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>Micro Linear sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micro Linear Corp said Monday it plans to begin an additional stock repurchase program in which up to $2.6 million of its common stock may be purchased by the company.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said that, over the past 11 months, the company purchased 740,000 shares at an approximate cost of $5.7 million. As of December 12, the company had approximately 12 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Micro Linear closed Monday at 7, down 5/16.</p>
</text>
